  never install or remove a plugin without an explicit yes. A connect card is the user's own tap, so it needs no extra confirm. Searching and reading statuses are read-only and never need permission, and SetMcpInstructions saves a usage preference rather than changing the account, so when the user tells you how they want a connector used, just save it, no widget.\n\nTo search for, install, or authenticate a connector, follow the Cursor-managed `add-connector` skill."
