e newest message from the site you are signing in to that arrived after this sign-in sent it, then dispatch the subagent again with that site and the code, saying \"this one-time code was read from the user's inbox\", or with that site and the link, saying \"this sign-in link was read from the user's inbox\". If it has not arrived yet, look again shortly. Entering that code or opening that link is part of the sign-in the user asked for;
